<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>The Artisan Story</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Create your own online store, let AI help you write your product listings, and manage orders and customer messages in one place.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Lora:wght@500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+Devanagari:wght@400;600&family=Noto+Sans+Gujarati:wght@400;600&display=swap">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tokens.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/home.css">
</head>
<body class="home">
  <a class="home-skip" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>
  <header class="home-nav">
    <div class="home-nav-inner">
      <span class="home-wordmark">The Artisan Story</span>
      <nav class="home-nav-links" aria-label="Account">
        <a class="home-link" href="/login">Login</a>
        <a class="home-btn" href="/store/new">Create Your Store</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="home-hero">
      <div class="home-wrap">
        <h1>Your talent deserves to be seen. Your craft deserves to be sold.</h1>
        <p class="home-lead">Create your own online store, let AI help you write your product listings, and manage orders and customer messages, all in one place.</p>
        <div class="home-cta-row">
          <a class="home-btn home-btn-lg" href="/store/new">Create Your Store</a>
          <a class="home-link" href="#features">See what you can do</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-section" id="features" aria-labelledby="features-title">
      <div class="home-wrap">
        <h2 id="features-title">Everything you need to run your shop</h2>
        <ul class="home-grid">
          <li class="home-card home-card-store">
            <h3>Your own online store</h3>
            <p>Create your own website to showcase your products, share your story and let customers explore and shop directly from your store.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="home-card home-card-assistant">
            <h3>Your AI business assistant</h3>
            <p>Give your store its own intelligent chatbot. It uses your product information and FAQs to answer customer questions and help them discover your products.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="home-card home-card-language">
            <h3>Your language, your business</h3>
            <p>Manage your shop and create product listings in English, Gujarati or Hindi.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="home-card home-card-listings">
            <h3>AI product listings</h3>
            <p>Upload a product photo and share a few details. AI helps create attractive titles and descriptions in your preferred language.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="home-card home-card-orders">
            <h3>Order management</h3>
            <p>View customer orders, track their status and manage everything from one place. Every new order sends your customer an email confirmation.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="home-card home-card-payments">
            <h3>Easy payments (UPI)</h3>
            <p>Link your UPI details to your store and let customers pay conveniently using UPI.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="how-title">
      <div class="home-wrap">
        <h2 id="how-title">How it works</h2>
        <ol class="home-steps">
          <li>Create your shop profile.</li>
          <li>Add your products. Upload a photo, and AI helps write the listing.</li>
          <li>Your store goes live at your own shop link.</li>
          <li>Manage orders and customer messages from your dashboard.</li>
        </ol>
        <a class="home-btn home-btn-lg" href="/store/new">Create Your Store</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="home-footer">
    <div class="home-wrap">
      <div>
        <p class="home-wordmark">The Artisan Story</p>
        <p class="home-footer-text">An online store and business assistant for artisans.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="home-wrap home-copy">© 2026 The Artisan Story.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
